('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001','putting','Putting greens','THE EVERYDAY ESCAPE','A place to work on your pace, find your line and enjoy a few putts, without leaving your property.','{"setting": "Outdoors or indoors", "alt": "Yellow flags on a landscaped putting green at sunset", "image_width": 768, "image_height": 576, "variants": [480, 768]}'::jsonb,'putting.jpg',true,false,0,true),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002','chipping','Chipping & pitching greens','A LITTLE MORE TOUCH','Bring approach practice closer to home with a dedicated green and space for those all-important short shots.','{"setting": "Outdoor practice", "alt": "Practice green beside a white sand bunker and mature trees", "image_width": 726, "image_height": 544, "variants": [480, 726]}'::jsonb,'chipping.jpg',true,false,1,true),
