('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004','simulator','Simulator bays','THE COURSE, CLOSER','Make room for practice and virtual rounds with a simulator setup planned around your room and your game.','{"setting": "Indoor spaces", "alt": "Golf simulator bay with a screen, hitting mat and wood-panelled surround at YENGolf Virtual Club", "image_width": 1080, "image_height": 810, "variants": [480, 800, 1080]}'::jsonb,'simulator.jpg',false,true,3,true),
('10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005','indoor-putting','Indoor putting studios','PRACTICE, ALL YEAR','Turn an indoor space into a dedicated putting studio for focused practice, relaxed play and time together.','{"setting": "Indoor spaces", "alt": "Indoor putting studio with multiple flags and a simulator screen", "image_width": 785, "image_height": 589, "variants": [480, 785]}'::jsonb,'indoor-putting.jpg',true,false,4,true),
